    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FENDI has just refreshed its bag lineup for the Fall/Winter 2026 collection. The iconic Peekaboo now comes in a long-strap version and a large tote, while the Baguette®26424 debuts in eel skin, long-haired shearling, embroidered suede, and military green canvas. The new FENDI Flow messenger bag features a compact boxy silhouette with an FF metal snap, striking a gender-neutral tone that echoes the season's \"shared wardrobe\" concept.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
