      "text": "Available in four sizes—extra-small, small, medium, and large—the bag comes in smooth calfskin and black crackled leather for a timeless, understated palette. For those seeking something more exotic, there are versions in eel skin, crocodile, woven leather, distressed leather, and pony hair—each one a unique signature.",
