    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Peekaboo Tote ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Peekaboo Tote boasts a soft rectangular silhouette with the iconic twist lock, offering a spacious interior that rivals a travel bag. It comes in large and small sizes. The khaki-green canvas version features abstract tiger motifs on both sides, trimmed with black calfskin and vintage silver hardware. There’s also a distressed leather edition that uses a special process to give the calfskin a soft, mottled look, evoking a sense of nostalgia.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
