    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· FENDI Flow Messenger ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The FENDI Flow messenger bag features a boxy silhouette with an FF metal snap, while side leather panels add a playful touch to the structured form, giving it a rugged workwear vibe. Offered in small and medium sizes, it comes in black grained calfskin, distressed calfskin, and camouflage-print technical fabric. The embroidered strap bears the FENDI ROMA 1925 lettering and the Cuneo motif from the Fall/Winter runway—an inspiration drawn from heart-shaped carvings on ancient Roman columns—adding a distinctive detail to the overall look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
